left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:83.3333%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 16.6667%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:83.3333%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 16.6667%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Library%20Tomb\">Ankrahmun Library Tomb</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Ruins%20Tomb\">Ancient Ruins Tomb</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Oasis%20Tomb\">Oasis Tomb</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mountain%20Tomb\">Mountain Tomb</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kharos\">Kharos</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">Pits of Inferno</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lich%20Hell\">Lich Hell</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ramoa\">Ramoa</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cemetery%20Quarter\">Cemetery Quarter</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>, underground of <a href=\"#/wiki/Fenrock\">Fenrock</a> (on the way to <a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar\">Beregar</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Masonry\">Old Masonry</a>). Can also be seen during an undead <a href=\"#/wiki/Raid\">raid</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThe Lich will chase the enemy while summoning <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeasts</a> and casting various draining spells.<br/><br/>A lich attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tYou should always try to stand at a diagonal from them, since their beam attack is very strong. You can also shoot <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bomb</a> on yourself to keep the summoned <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeasts</a> away from reaching you. Also be careful if they have 3 or more <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeasts</a>, as they can trap you easily and can do 200-300 damage per turn easily, even if diagonal.<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch added a \"very rare\" chance of looting <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> from this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,726 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied aft